As a registered user of the application
I want to log in to my account using my email address and password
So that I can access my personalized dashboard and account features
Acceptance Criteria:

I can enter my email address in the designated field
I can enter my password in the password field (with characters masked for security)
I can optionally check "Remember Me" to stay logged in on this device
I can click the "Login" button to authenticate and access my account
If I forget my password, I can click "Forget Password?" to initiate password recovery
The system validates my credentials and either grants access or shows an error message
Upon successful login, I am redirected to my account dashboard or the page I was trying to access
